OL,3,GNEWSAReform expels councillor after
OL,4,AFacebook post trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FGibbins was sentenced to a 12-month
OL,7,Fcommunity order with 150 hours of
OL,8,Funpaid work over the post made in March
OL,9,F2024, which came to light two years
OL,10,Flater when he was elected to represent
OL,11,Fthe Hylton Castle ward.
